Z||000000||Wolfhound||08-01-2000||03:42 PM||||I just returned from two weeks work in Huntsville Alabama. I was in my VW Van and my associate had a Mazda pickup. I saw more Fieros in any one town (on the road) than anywhere I,ve every been. (14) <BR>Also made it up to Toney Alabama to the Fiero Factory. It was a Saturday afternoon and they were closed. There was a mechanic there who was doing as he called it catch up work. He let us in and I asked if we could take a look around. He said make yourself at home and we did. WOW! I took photos  and they will follow. This is my third atempt to post and the telephone company is working up the road. <BR>Coy<p>[This message has been edited by Wolfhound (edited 08-03-2000).]||||reg||14
